35.45pt'>

<div class=Section1>

<p class=ALTBASLIK style='tab-stops:35.45pt'><span style='font-size:14.0pt;
font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";color:maroon;mso-ansi-language:TR'>BEDELSİZ
İHRACATA İLİŞKİN TEBLİĞ<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=ALTBASLIK style='tab-stops:35.45pt'><span style='font-size:14.0pt;
font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";color:maroon;mso-ansi-language:TR'>(İHRACAT
2008/12)<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=Baslk align=right style='margin-bottom:2.0pt;text-align:right;
tab-stops:35.45pt'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span
style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-ansi-language:
TR;text-decoration:none;text-underline:none'>Dış Ticaret Müsteşarlığından:
12.07.2008 tarihli ve 26934 sayılı R.G.<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>

